     "h": 334,
     "title": "Intelligent robot base module",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Intelligent robot base module</h3> <p>Robot base module - in which the FANUC 6-axis articulated arm robot grips the tools and reliably transports them between the input/output module and the lift system.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/0/csm_loadBox_info_liftsystem_cb27c37c80.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 616,
     "h": 334,
     "title": "Efficient lift system",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Efficient lift system</h3> <p>Kardex Shuttle lift system - provides the tools from the tool store. The tools are retrieved from the lift system via trays fitted with ZOLLER carrier racks and picked using the »loadBox« automation system. </p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/c/csm_loadBox_info_eingabeeinheit_5f5cd28541.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 616,
     "h": 334,
     "title": "State-of-the-art input/output module",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>State-of-the-art input/output module</h3> <p>Input/output module for the »smartPallet system«- used to securely hold your tool pallets. The tool pallets can be delivered using either the manual pallet trolley or the »coraExpress« driverless transport system.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/e/csm_loadBox_info_cokcpit_b07f5a49e4.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 616,
     "h": 334,
     "title": "Server-based control software",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Server-based control software</h3> <p>Control software - for operating the automation system. The control software can be displayed on various display devices (monitor, tablet or smartphone). </p> </figcaption>"
    }
